    "description": "The Utility Billing Reminder Retrieval API allows consumers to access and retrieve a list of upcoming utility billing reminders. This service is designed for utility companies and their customers to ensure timely communication regarding billing due dates. By providing insights into billing schedules, users can better manage their finances and avoid late payments. This API is particularly useful for integrating reminder notifications into customer portals or mobile applications, enhancing client engagement and satisfaction.",
